<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-GRIQUAS 64-3 AT LUNCH ON LAST DAY VS TVL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GRIQUAS 64-3 AT LUNCH ON LAST DAY VS TVL.</headline>
<dateline>KIMBERLEY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griqualand West were 64 for three at lunch on Monday, needing 308 in a minimum of 94 overs to defeat Transvaal on the final day of their Supersport Series match.</p>
<p>Scores: Griqualand West 327 &amp; 64-3, Transvaal 440-6 dec &amp; 194-4 dec (Adam Bacher 112 not out, Nic Pothas 37 not out).</p>
</text>
